{%- comment -%} ======== OUR STORY ======== {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="wrap sec">
  <div class="story">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">From the shed to the site</span>
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:20px">Keep every meal hot.</h2>
      <p>Yakka Essential was built for the way Australians actually work — long drives, no kitchen, and a lunch break that's over before the queue moves. It's the simplest possible fix: charge it, pack it, eat properly.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Zero waiting.</b> Your break is short enough. Skip the queue and eat the moment you sit down.</li>
        <li><b>Completely cordless.</b> No outlet, no inverter, no gennie. It runs off its own battery.</li>
        <li><b>Even-heat technology.</b> No hot centre and burnt edges — just perfectly hot food, every time.</li>
        <li><b>Built for big appetites.</b> 1.5L capacity designed to hold a proper, energy-packed feed.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    {%- if section.settings.story_image != blank -%}
      <img src="{{ section.settings.story_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="Our Story" loading="lazy">
    {%- else -%}
      <img src="{{ 'yakka-hero-12.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Our Story" loading="lazy">
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{%- comment -%} ======== FAQ ======== {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="wrap sec center">
  <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
  <h2 style="margin:16px auto 0">Common questions.</h2>
  <div class="faq">
    <div>
      <h3>How long does it take to heat my food? <span>▾</span></h3>
      <p>Approximately 45 minutes from cold to piping hot (75 °C+), depending on the type and volume of food. Denser meals like rice and stew may take slightly longer.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Do I need to plug it in to heat? <span>▾</span></h3>
      <p>No. The Yakka Essential is 100 % cordless. The detachable battery pack powers the heating element — no outlet, no inverter, no generator required.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>What foods can I heat? <span>▾</span></h3>
      <p>Anything you'd normally microwave — rice, pasta, curries, stews, soup, casseroles, stir-fry. Avoid raw meats; this is a reheater, not a cooker.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>How do I clean it? <span>▾</span></h3>
      <p>The 304 stainless-steel inner pot lifts out and is hand-washable. Wipe the base unit with a damp cloth. Do not submerge the base or battery.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>What's the return policy? <span>▾</span></h3>
      <p>60-day money-back guarantee. If you're not satisfied, send it back for a full refund — we even cover return postage within Australia.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{%- comment -%} ======== CTA BAND ======== {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="band">
